WEBVTT

00:00.690 --> 00:02.720
<i>Witches cannot tell a lie.</i>

00:05.730 --> 00:11.330
<i>Thus witches live separately from humans, 
and exist as different beings.</i>

00:11.970 --> 00:16.920
<i>Since my mother was a witch, 
I was born one as well.</i>

00:17.950 --> 00:21.770
<i>My mother died at a young age,
and I lived with my grandmother, but...</i>

00:22.170 --> 00:27.540
<i>She also returned to the earth four 
years ago, and now I'm alone.</i>

00:29.760 --> 00:32.830
<i>On the outskirts of the royal 
capital, deep within the forest,</i>

00:33.800 --> 00:37.230
<i>there is an isolated small island 
floating in the middle of a lake.</i>

00:38.300 --> 00:41.280
<i>There stands a witch's hermitage.</i>

01:24.250 --> 01:29.320
<i>Those who visit the hermitage usually 
come seeking a witch's secret remedy.</i>

01:30.860 --> 01:33.760
<i>What they seek tends 
to be something shady,</i>

01:34.150 --> 01:36.970
<i>so they often have complex pasts 
and try to hide their identities.</i>

01:37.820 --> 01:40.760
<i>That's why, in that sense...</i>

01:42.510 --> 01:44.630
<i>It was an unexpected visitor.</i>

01:50.620 --> 01:52.210
Pardon me.

01:52.210 --> 01:55.830
Am I correct to assume that this is 
the home of the Witch of the Lake?

01:56.190 --> 01:57.490
Yes...

01:57.490 --> 01:58.990
That's right.

01:58.990 --> 02:01.760
This is the hermitage of 
the "Good" Witch of the Lake.

02:03.270 --> 02:05.030
I have a request for you.

02:05.030 --> 02:07.300
There are reasons I can't
 reveal my identity.

02:06.260 --> 02:08.430
<i>I know who he is.</i>

02:07.300 --> 02:08.440
I hope you understand.

02:08.830 --> 02:12.790
<i>Harij Azm, an elite knight who 
works at the royal palace.</i>

02:09.300 --> 02:10.620
Will you accept my request?

02:16.600 --> 02:19.410
What sort of request 
is it, my dear client?

02:20.000 --> 02:23.680
<i>How much nicer it would have been 
if I could just openly call him</i>

02:23.680 --> 02:25.250
<i>by his name, "Lord Harij".</i>

02:27.950 --> 02:30.160
I would like you to make 
me a love potion.

02:33.910 --> 02:36.300
That's...

02:41.220 --> 02:43.680
<b>Nom. Nom. Nom. Nom.</b>

02:45.230 --> 02:48.640
Unfortunately, the love potion 
is currently out of stock.

02:49.000 --> 02:50.840
So, it's something you could make then.

02:51.730 --> 02:53.050
Oh, uh...

02:53.400 --> 02:54.460
<i>Shoot!</i>

02:55.120 --> 02:56.860
<i>I may have slipped up.</i>

02:57.300 --> 02:58.860
Well, yes.

02:59.240 --> 03:00.990
Then I shall request it.

03:00.990 --> 03:03.950
If there are any items needed 
for it, I shall procure them.

03:04.830 --> 03:06.380
It'll be quite expensive.

03:06.380 --> 03:08.010
Then that is what I will pay.

03:08.010 --> 03:11.190
And it will take quite a bit of time.

03:11.190 --> 03:12.040
Then I shall wait.

03:19.820 --> 03:23.420
I apologize, however I have 
reasons why I cannot back down.

03:25.490 --> 03:26.870
Very well.

03:26.870 --> 03:29.890
I will gather the ingredients needed, 
so if you could please wait.

03:49.330 --> 03:52.160
First, if you could please 
gather the things on here.

03:56.320 --> 03:57.330
I appreciate it.

03:59.780 --> 04:05.130
<i>And so, this is how the witch was 
heartbroken due to a love potion.</i>

04:18.110 --> 04:23.150
<b>Hello, I am a Witch</b>

04:18.110 --> 04:23.150
<b>and my Crush Wants me to Make a Love Potion</b>

06:00.390 --> 06:03.060
I know it's pointless for 
me to do this, but...

06:09.590 --> 06:12.930
Welcome. Have you brought 
the things I've asked for?

06:13.250 --> 06:14.110
Yeah.

06:14.900 --> 06:17.100
I'll assist with your belongings.

06:22.640 --> 06:25.740
Now then, allow me to 
check the ingredients.

06:25.740 --> 06:30.380
The liver of a fire rat intoxicated
 by the cries of a collared bat, correct?

06:30.380 --> 06:31.310
Yes.

06:41.060 --> 06:42.870
So, Lady Witch,

06:42.870 --> 06:45.700
do you brew your remedies 
in a place like this?

06:45.700 --> 06:47.110
Well, yes.

06:47.110 --> 06:48.670
I-I see...

06:49.000 --> 06:51.330
Yes, what you brought is correct.

06:51.330 --> 06:54.810
It has been a while since I've seen 
one in such pristine condition.

06:55.860 --> 06:57.040
Then finally you can...

06:57.040 --> 06:59.850
Yes, finally I can request 
the next ingredient.

07:00.190 --> 07:01.050
The next one is...

07:01.340 --> 07:02.890
There's still more?!

07:02.890 --> 07:04.610
How many times has it been now?!

07:04.800 --> 07:07.570
Pollen from a flower which 
only blooms on a sheer cliff!

07:07.570 --> 07:10.270
The first drop to fall from the heavens!

07:10.270 --> 07:13.240
The root of a medicinal herb 
that lets out a loud scream!

07:13.240 --> 07:14.980
And the ones even after that!

07:14.980 --> 07:17.700
They are all things that 
take a long time to get!

07:17.960 --> 07:20.540
Why can't you just request all 
of these things at once?!

07:20.540 --> 07:23.880
If this were the royal palace apothecary, 
they would have been punished for sure!

07:32.770 --> 07:35.000
I apologize for raising my voice.

07:35.390 --> 07:39.860
<i>He's irritable, intimidating, 
and has a sharp tongue...</i>

07:39.860 --> 07:42.220
<i>and yet, his voice is so gentle.</i>

07:42.530 --> 07:44.680
Um, I'm sorry...

07:45.980 --> 07:47.970
No, it's just that you're so radiant.

07:47.970 --> 07:48.770
Huh?

07:48.770 --> 07:51.290
Dear client, you have such 
a handsome face, so...

07:52.970 --> 07:54.550
What are you even saying?

07:54.550 --> 07:55.830
I said what I said.

07:56.190 --> 07:57.790
I can't put up with this.

07:58.140 --> 08:00.070
<i>That expression is nice, too...</i>

08:00.600 --> 08:02.740
<i>He truly has a handsome face.</i>

08:04.490 --> 08:05.890
And?

08:05.890 --> 08:07.890
What should I bring next?

08:07.890 --> 08:09.410
Please wait a moment.

08:09.410 --> 08:10.460
I'll jot it down right now.

08:10.790 --> 08:12.830
Please write down as 
many things as you can.

08:12.830 --> 08:13.920
Oh...

08:14.250 --> 08:18.530
<i>Not only is Lord Harij unaware 
of my unrequited love for him,</i>

08:19.020 --> 08:21.880
<i>he absolutely has no
 idea who I am, either.</i>

08:22.800 --> 08:26.990
<i>It was just love at first 
sight, long long ago.</i>

08:27.530 --> 08:29.110
<i>That's all it was.</i>

08:29.740 --> 08:33.570
<i>The most an unnoticed 
reclusive witch can do</i>

08:34.100 --> 08:37.690
<i>is to buy some time until she 
has to hand over the potion.</i>

08:39.400 --> 08:43.520
The next ingredient is the 
antennae of a rainbow-colored grasshopper.

08:44.370 --> 08:47.720
Be certain to pluck it on 
the night of a full moon.

08:49.610 --> 08:52.770
The full moon just ended 
last week, did it not?

08:52.770 --> 08:53.770
It did.

08:53.770 --> 08:56.910
I'm not as free as you might think.

08:58.210 --> 09:01.130
If you do not have the time, then
I suppose nothing can be done.

09:01.130 --> 09:02.630
How very unfortunate.

09:06.570 --> 09:08.220
I guess I have no choice.

09:09.200 --> 09:12.300
<i>He must truly want this person's attention
 to go through all this trouble.</i>

09:14.350 --> 09:15.850
Ah, what a waste!

09:15.850 --> 09:17.070
Wh-What?

09:17.070 --> 09:20.370
Please tell me the next time 
you're about to sigh.

09:20.370 --> 09:21.280
Huh?

09:21.600 --> 09:25.750
The sigh of a beautiful man can be 
used as an ingredient for remedies.

09:26.950 --> 09:28.660
As if I'd ever tell you!

09:40.290 --> 09:43.860
<i>The thought of wanting him to fall 
for me hasn't crossed my mind.</i>

09:44.590 --> 09:49.160
<i>If he can remember even the slightest 
bit of me, that's all I ask...</i>

09:47.060 --> 09:50.060
<b>Hello, I am a Witch and
my Crush Wants me to
Make a Love Potion</b>

09:50.060 --> 09:53.070
<b>Hello, I am a Witch</b>

09:50.060 --> 09:53.070
<b>and my Crush Wants me to Make a Love Potion</b>

10:00.980 --> 10:03.920
It's rare to see you yawn.

10:03.920 --> 10:04.960
Huh, yeah...

10:04.960 --> 10:05.860
Here.

10:06.280 --> 10:07.400
Thanks.

10:07.670 --> 10:09.370
I haven't been sleeping much.

10:09.660 --> 10:12.630
What, were you out having fun all night?

10:12.630 --> 10:14.900
As if you'd be doing 
something like that—

10:14.900 --> 10:17.210
Yeah, fun I haven't had in a while.

10:17.990 --> 10:21.910
After all, I spent the whole 
night chasing grasshoppers.

10:21.910 --> 10:23.300
Grasshoppers?

10:23.300 --> 10:27.330
You hang a slice of onion 
and pull when it bites,

10:27.330 --> 10:29.710
but it's tough getting the 
hang of it, you see...

10:29.710 --> 10:31.270
It's a rather deep art.

10:31.270 --> 10:34.260
Well, that certainly sounds 
like a lot of fun.

10:34.260 --> 10:37.700
Yeah. Once you try it, you find
yourself surprisingly engrossed in it.

10:37.700 --> 10:39.240
I felt like a kid again.

10:40.700 --> 10:44.040
Harij, chasing bugs is fine and all,

10:44.040 --> 10:47.200
but isn't there something else 
you should be chasing more?

10:47.720 --> 10:50.810
Something else I should be chasing... Oh.

10:50.810 --> 10:51.790
Is it criminals?

10:51.790 --> 10:54.120
No, well, you're not wrong per se,

10:54.120 --> 10:57.000
considering it's our duty as 
knights, but that's not it.

10:58.450 --> 11:01.430
Harij, what you should be chasing is...

11:02.530 --> 11:04.130
happiness.

11:08.290 --> 11:10.240
Isn't there anyone nice 
that comes to mind?

11:10.240 --> 11:12.100
Are you my parents when I visit home?

11:12.590 --> 11:16.310
Well, busy as you are, you don't
 have time to mingle, I suppose.

11:16.570 --> 11:18.140
Yeah, you don't.

11:18.140 --> 11:19.520
Right?

11:24.270 --> 11:25.580
You don't.

11:48.470 --> 11:49.880
Hey, Rose!

11:50.250 --> 11:52.350
Oh, it's you, Tien.

11:55.630 --> 11:57.200
<i>He is Tien Công.</i>

11:57.610 --> 12:01.770
<i>He's a merchant I've known since 
my grandmother was alive.</i>

12:03.230 --> 12:07.140
You didn't notice the bell ring? 
How unusual for you.

12:07.140 --> 12:10.410
I did hear it, but I couldn't 
see well in the dark.

12:10.410 --> 12:14.870
So the magical bell the ancestors created 
wasn't omnipotent, I take it?

12:15.130 --> 12:19.360
It is still useful just to be able to tell
when someone approaches the pier though.

12:19.920 --> 12:23.540
Oh, I see you worked 
hard to make a bunch.

12:23.540 --> 12:26.220
Well then, let's get 
right to checking them.

12:26.220 --> 12:29.130
A remedy that warms one up 
when rubbed in, and...

12:29.130 --> 12:33.010
A remedy that makes one look younger when 
applied to hair and left on for a while.

12:33.010 --> 12:36.160
And, there's the remedy for 
removing stubborn pot stains.

12:36.160 --> 12:37.390
Yep, all there.

12:38.270 --> 12:40.810
Mm, what a nice color.

12:40.810 --> 12:42.790
Impressive as always, Rose.

12:42.790 --> 12:44.040
Why, thank you.

12:44.040 --> 12:46.080
The witch's secret remedy, too, of course,

12:46.080 --> 12:48.780
but you're so good at making 
everyday remedies, Rose.

12:49.420 --> 12:51.750
Surely, anyone can make those.

12:52.050 --> 12:54.460
I'm afraid not just anyone.

12:54.790 --> 12:57.250
Witches are only born from witches.

12:57.250 --> 12:59.470
Their very existence is valuable.

12:59.470 --> 13:03.320
In this day and age, there are so few 
witches who possess this much power.

13:03.980 --> 13:07.460
I think you should believe 
in yourself more, Rose.

13:07.670 --> 13:10.170
It's not really about 
confidence, more like...

13:10.170 --> 13:12.220
Well, I've been at this for four years, after all.

13:14.930 --> 13:18.270
Four years, huh. It's already 
been that long, hasn't it?

13:19.060 --> 13:20.230
Yeah...

13:21.740 --> 13:24.190
You've grown so big...

13:24.190 --> 13:27.030
The Rose, who was once <i>this</i> tiny.

13:27.030 --> 13:28.990
I wasn't <i>that</i> small...

13:29.430 --> 13:30.690
Is that right?

13:31.020 --> 13:34.690
When I first met you, you were hiding 
behind your Grandmother's skirt,

13:34.690 --> 13:36.530
so I couldn't really see you well.

13:36.690 --> 13:38.690
Just forget about that already...

13:40.130 --> 13:44.090
All right, we're good for the 
delivery this time, and...

13:44.090 --> 13:46.440
I want to ask for this much next time.

13:47.030 --> 13:50.300
Ugh. This is a lot, you know...

13:50.300 --> 13:52.400
And all just everyday remedies, too.

13:52.400 --> 13:54.350
I can't do anything about that.

13:54.700 --> 13:59.270
The witch's secret remedies you brew are 
well-made and in high demand, but...

13:59.270 --> 14:01.430
It's for a hefty price, after all.

14:01.430 --> 14:03.510
I just can't sell as many.

14:03.510 --> 14:05.920
That's why I have to brew 
a lot of everyday remedies

14:05.920 --> 14:08.090
in order for you to 
make a living, right?

14:08.090 --> 14:09.280
Exactly.

14:09.280 --> 14:11.730
I understand that, but...

14:11.730 --> 14:14.460
One option is to raise 
the unit price, too.

14:14.460 --> 14:15.460
The unit price?

14:15.460 --> 14:18.060
Yep, you know how there's the 
remedy that you spray around

14:18.060 --> 14:20.920
one's neck before a date
that's been selling well recently?

14:21.660 --> 14:23.170
Oh, this?

14:23.170 --> 14:26.910
You see, I wanted to consult 
you on changing its bottle.

14:26.910 --> 14:27.880
Huh.

14:27.880 --> 14:32.050
After all, that remedy is extremely 
popular amongst the young women.

14:32.050 --> 14:36.600
I think if we use cute packaging, even if 
we bump the price a bit, it'll still sell.

14:36.980 --> 14:38.060
Oh.

14:38.550 --> 14:40.690
For instance... Let's see, hmm.

14:41.440 --> 14:43.430
How about something like this?

14:43.680 --> 14:45.770
Sure, anything will do.

14:45.990 --> 14:47.110
You think?

14:47.110 --> 14:50.880
Then from now on, use this bottle for the
remedy that you spray around one's neck...

14:50.880 --> 14:52.180
Jeez, that's long.

14:52.180 --> 14:54.270
Why don't we give this remedy a name?

14:54.270 --> 14:56.500
Since we're changing the bottle anyway.

14:56.500 --> 15:00.460
What? I don't understand that 
sort of thing, so I'll pass.

15:00.460 --> 15:01.450
Nor am I interested.

15:01.760 --> 15:03.420
You're not interested?!

15:03.700 --> 15:05.770
You've become completely bitter 
and jaded, haven't you?

15:05.770 --> 15:08.170
You used to be so adorable 
back then, too...

15:08.170 --> 15:10.620
Big Brother Tien is sad.

15:11.000 --> 15:13.300
You're a bit too old to be called 
"Big Brother," you know.

15:13.300 --> 15:15.030
We're more than ten
 years apart, after all.

15:15.030 --> 15:16.480
You're just an old man!

15:16.480 --> 15:18.210
Old...

15:18.210 --> 15:20.240
Mm, well, I suppose 
that's not bad either!

15:24.400 --> 15:27.560
Well then, I think it's about 
time this old man heads off.

15:27.560 --> 15:29.490
I'll stop by again soon.

15:29.490 --> 15:30.350
Okay, okay.

15:30.860 --> 15:33.330
Don't get too bitter now.

15:33.330 --> 15:34.070
Shush, you.

15:38.570 --> 15:40.370
<i>How can I not be bitter?</i>

15:40.800 --> 15:42.080
<i>The other day,</i>

15:42.080 --> 15:45.420
<i>the person I had been quietly crushing
on for four years came to see me,</i>

15:46.180 --> 15:49.010
<i>seeking a love potion he intends 
to use on someone he loves.</i>

15:59.520 --> 16:02.270
Ugh, I've done it now.

16:02.270 --> 16:04.720
Guess I better clean this up... Oh.

16:09.240 --> 16:10.400
This is...

16:14.800 --> 16:17.790
<i>It was shortly after my 
grandmother passed away.</i>

16:15.860 --> 16:19.680
I have some freshly baked 
bread for a cheap price!

16:18.260 --> 16:20.470
<i>I had run out of ingredients 
for my concoctions,</i>

16:20.470 --> 16:23.410
<i>and it was the day I visited the royal 
capital alone for the first time.</i>

16:24.320 --> 16:27.380
<i>My grandmother used to 
always bring me with her,</i>

16:27.380 --> 16:30.260
<i>so I was at a loss to find the shops
she frequented on my own.</i>

16:30.540 --> 16:33.190
Please! I'd love for you to show 
me everything you have next time!

16:35.320 --> 16:37.170
<i>Without the leisure to 
enjoy the royal capital</i>

16:37.170 --> 16:38.880
<i>which overflowed with 
smiles and liveliness...</i>

16:44.120 --> 16:49.860
<i>The people of the bustling city only 
made me feel all the more pathetic.</i>

16:51.520 --> 16:53.250
By the way, did you hear?

16:53.250 --> 16:55.600
About the death of the Witch of the Lake.

16:56.820 --> 16:58.150
You serious?!

16:58.150 --> 17:01.030
That granny's been around 
ever since I was a kid.

17:01.030 --> 17:03.230
Rumors say she's lived for 
two hundred years, right?

17:03.230 --> 17:06.890
Though I really thought she would live 
for another hundred years or so.

17:07.810 --> 17:11.300
<i>You're wrong. Grandma didn't 
live for two hundred years.</i>

17:11.300 --> 17:13.470
<i>They're combining her with our ancestors.</i>

17:13.810 --> 17:17.260
<i>For the sake of my grandma's honor, 
I need to go correct them.</i>

17:17.630 --> 17:20.670
In any case, we can 
finally feel at ease!

17:21.880 --> 17:24.150
<i>At ease? Why?</i>

17:24.150 --> 17:27.280
Just the thought of a witch coming 
was enough to make me feel anxious.

17:27.280 --> 17:30.080
She always seemed like she was 
trying to avoid being seen, too.

17:30.080 --> 17:32.600
I bet she knowingly did shady things.

17:32.600 --> 17:33.890
Right?

17:33.890 --> 17:36.830
And yet, she'd come into town 
looking completely nonchalant.

17:36.830 --> 17:37.990
How terrifying.

17:37.990 --> 17:39.800
What if a child were to get abducted?

17:39.800 --> 17:41.310
Did that sort of thing actually happen?!

17:41.310 --> 17:45.560
You know, kind of like the time when 
people used to disappear back then?

17:45.560 --> 17:48.160
That definitely had to have 
been her. The witch's doing.

17:50.110 --> 17:53.560
But from now on we won't 
have to worry about that!

17:53.560 --> 17:55.540
Man, am I glad!

17:55.860 --> 17:59.000
<i>That was when I first found out.</i>

17:59.000 --> 18:02.880
<i>That witches are so loathed that 
their deaths make people rejoice.</i>

18:02.880 --> 18:04.840
<i>I wonder if grandma knew.</i>

18:05.170 --> 18:09.010
<i>She may have been tolerating 
it this whole time on her own.</i>

18:09.650 --> 18:10.990
<i>This malice.</i>

18:10.990 --> 18:13.430
Then cheers to the witch's death!

18:14.260 --> 18:16.250
Don't you mean a toast?

18:16.250 --> 18:20.100
Ah, whatever. We can just 
finally feel at ease.

18:21.660 --> 18:24.940
It's sickening to hear that you 
feel relief from a person's death.

18:26.280 --> 18:27.740
Owner, check please.

18:27.740 --> 18:28.790
Y-Yes, sir.

18:28.790 --> 18:32.670
Hey buddy, you say "person," but you know 
the one that died is a witch, right?

18:32.670 --> 18:33.740
What of it?

18:34.140 --> 18:35.970
No doubt, witches are humans as well.

18:36.300 --> 18:39.930
Have you all been wronged 
by a witch before?

18:39.930 --> 18:41.450
No...

18:41.450 --> 18:43.030
But, you know... right?

18:43.030 --> 18:43.630
Yeah...

18:43.630 --> 18:47.920
If it were me, I'd curse whoever 
rejoiced at my death.

18:49.810 --> 18:52.940
You best pray that she's a "good" witch.

18:58.030 --> 18:59.400
Hey, Harij!

18:59.400 --> 19:01.880
Lord Azm, please wait!

19:03.430 --> 19:07.150
That indigo cloak... So he was 
from the Order of Knights.

19:07.150 --> 19:11.040
Speaking of Azm, wasn't that the 
name of the Haizuran lord?

19:11.040 --> 19:13.120
You better not have made him angry!

19:13.120 --> 19:14.750
We've got nothing to do with this.

19:15.620 --> 19:17.330
Harij Azm...

19:18.500 --> 19:21.600
<i>That day, I fell in love.</i>

19:22.480 --> 19:26.630
<i>Even though I knew he was someone 
I would never end up with.</i>

19:35.520 --> 19:36.980
The sound of the bell!

19:37.970 --> 19:40.510
Ow!

19:50.240 --> 19:51.180
Oh...

20:10.750 --> 20:12.630
It's not like there's 
any reason behind it.

20:21.440 --> 20:23.480
It's not like there's 
any reason behind it.

20:28.520 --> 20:29.680
Oh, you're kidding me!

20:30.210 --> 20:33.010
<i>If Lord Harij were to come now...</i>

20:33.660 --> 20:35.440
<i>No, that's not possible.</i>

20:35.440 --> 20:37.560
<i>He's only visited during 
the night this whole time.</i>

20:37.560 --> 20:38.870
<i>But, then again maybe...</i>

20:49.480 --> 20:51.300
Jeez!

20:52.770 --> 20:53.940
I-It's not like!

20:53.940 --> 20:56.510
It's not like I would have 
cared if it was him!

20:56.510 --> 20:58.640
Honestly! There's no reason 
behind it after all!

21:04.150 --> 21:06.070
I feel strangely exhausted.

21:06.640 --> 21:10.390
<i>I'm not used to having my 
heart stirred like this.</i>

21:11.400 --> 21:17.170
<i>I've been living alone all this time, and 
my daily routine has mostly been the same.</i>

21:17.560 --> 21:20.300
<i>Even the love I've held in 
my heart from four years ago,</i>

21:20.300 --> 21:23.810
<i>I occasionally sneak 
it out, reflect on it,</i>

21:23.810 --> 21:26.790
<i>and reminisce on what a 
fond memory it was.</i>

21:27.820 --> 21:29.710
<i>That's how it was supposed
 to be, and yet...</i>

21:29.710 --> 21:33.260
<i>Every time that bell rings, 
my heart begins to race...</i>

21:33.710 --> 21:35.230
<i>And then the fear sinks in.</i>

21:36.220 --> 21:41.070
<i>However, Lord Harij isn't 
necessarily coming to see "me."</i>

21:42.070 --> 21:43.880
<i>He comes to see the "witch."</i>

21:45.470 --> 21:49.930
I need to clearly understand that.

21:51.170 --> 21:53.700
<i>I've known that a for long time.</i>

21:54.280 --> 21:57.080
<i>It's fine if these feelings 
never reach him.</i>

21:58.000 --> 22:01.540
<i>Is what I want to say, but...</i>

22:02.100 --> 22:03.830
<i>Is what I should have said, but...</i>

22:04.500 --> 22:10.010
<b>Episode 1:
The Witch and the
Love Potion of Unrequited Love</b>

22:04.920 --> 22:08.920
<i>I can't lie, even to myself.</i>
